WEBVTT

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:20.750
Talulah.

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:23.920
Everything is in place.

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:26.590
It's time to move.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.760
What's the matter?

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:37.240
It's true that taking Lungmen 
will be beneficial to Reunion.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:38.640
However...

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:42.200
It's too risky, and the 
price is going to be steep.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.610
Why are you so fixated on Lungmen?

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.770
Crownslayer...

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:53.830
Have you seen that building?

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.260
Yes.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.410
It's a symbol of Lungmen.

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:06.420
I came back here because I want to take 
back everything that belongs to us.

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:11.670
And to make them pay.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:16.300
Isn't it more fun that way?

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:20.570
Right, Talulah?

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:59.760
You're late, Rhodes Island.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:04.980
We were ambushed by Reunion 
multiple times on our way here.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:06.420
No excuses.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:08.040
This is not an excuse.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:13.310
A considerable Reunion force 
is occupying the slums.

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:17.340
It's not safe here, either. Please get
 Misha away from here as soon as possible.

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:21.680
So you are Misha?

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:22.920
Y-Yes.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.720
From here on, the L.G.D. will protect you.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:27.730
Get her into the car.

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:28.300
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:31.080
Come with me.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:33.980
Misha.

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:36.300
It's okay.

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:37.800
Yeah...

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:47.090
Madame Ch'en, I have a request.

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:47.870
What is it?

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:54.240
Promise me you will guarantee Misha's safety
 and give her the medical attention she needs.

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:55.300
Of course.

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:58.930
Misha's condition is very serious.

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:03.720
Once everything's done, I would like to 
take her to Rhodes Island for treatment.

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:09.040
Right. I'll pass on your 
request to Chief Wei.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.850
As soon as we're done, 
we'll transfer her to Rhodes Island.

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:16.170
That is, if we don't run into
 any problems with her.

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:19.860
I can trust you... right?

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:21.720
Yes.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:22.580
Let's go.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.010
Amiya...

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:31.970
We're just saying goodbye 
for the time being, Misha.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:43.580
Rhodes Island... will always welcome you.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.540
See you again.

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:48.190
Yeah. See you.

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:49.350
Bye then...

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:50.220
Um...

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:56.270
Next time, could you teach me how to
 make the doll the kids had with them?

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.090
Doll?

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:03.400
Okay. Let's make one together.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.080
Amiya...

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:21.070
We don't have a choice but 
to trust them, right, Doctor?

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:22.420
Right.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.650
Seems that's a wrap for this 
mission. For now, at least.

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:30.300
That Monster Inspector isn't planning 
on telling us anything, is she?

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:34.040
Who exactly is Misha, anyway?

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:37.440
We need to know.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:42.960
The L.G.D. guys are always so scary.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:46.700
Feeling guilty about something 
you did, little angel?

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:51.520
Nope. I just don't want their attention.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:52.370
Amiya.

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:53.740
Any other work?

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:59.360
No, that's it. We escorted her to the L.G.D. 
safely. That's all we have for now.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:01.760
In that case, we'll get going.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:04.250
What? That's boring!

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:08.100
Oh, I know! How about I take you guys
 back to Rhodes Island?

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:14.740
Thanks, but I'd like to ask Penguin Logistics
 to keep investigating Reunion for us.

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:19.020
No problem at all! Just leave it to us!

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.740
Exusiai, let's go.

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:24.590
Jeez, fine.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:27.090
We'll let you know as soon 
as we notice anything.

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:28.780
Thank you.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:31.350
See you later, then!

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:35.290
We should head back to Rhodes Island now.

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:40.640
How are we getting there? There are 
a lot of Reunion forces hiding around here.

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:45.300
That's fine. It'll actually be better 
if they come after us themselves.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:48.920
Oh? So you want to bait them toward us?

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:50.060
Yes.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:53.430
We'll gather all the Operators 
scattered around the slums.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:58.350
Let's all do what we can 
to ensure Misha's safety.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:16.240
Why were you looking for me?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.710
Is it because... I'm infected?

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:26.840
I don't remember ever doing anything
 that you might want me for.

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:34.450
You're not the reason. It's your father.

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:35.350
Huh?

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:40.120
Your father was Chernobog's 
most renowned scientist.

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:44.310
Reunion wants to get their hands 
on his daughter. That's you.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.770
We don't have a clear idea 
what their objective is,

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:52.450
but we thought it necessary to ensure
 you don't fall into their hands.

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:59.450
Which means I'll be losing 
my freedom for a while, right?

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.650
"Dragon lady."

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.540
That's you, right?

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:11.470
The kids in the slums told me about you.

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:16.090
They said there was a "dragon lady"
 who was always helping them.

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:24.300
Please... keep taking care of them...

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:34.430
Lungmen doesn't recognize the Infected 
or the slums dwellers as citizens.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.070
That said...

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:41.200
I'm always willing to do my job.

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:44.960
Madame Ch'en?

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:50.790
We're under attack!

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:57.220
Get down!

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:06.980
Now, let the games begin!

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.230
Jeez!

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:12.650
Just how persistent can you guys be?

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:19.070
Franka!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:24.670
How did they get so many inside the city?

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.100
Rhodes Island...

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:44.310
Where did you take her?

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:47.940
You're the one from before...

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:52.690
Did you hand her over to Lungmen?

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:57.200
Does it have anything to do with you?

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:03.200
Damn you! You're an Infected, 
yet you helped Lungmen?!

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:07.210
What you've done is a
 betrayal of <i>all</i> the Infected!

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:13.460
Leader of Rhodes Island! You will pay for 
the lives of our brethren with your blood!

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:15.850
Reunion...

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:21.470
You were the first to hate.

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:24.970
You hurt the first innocent.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:28.480
You threw the first stone.

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:32.230
Back in Chernobog, it was all you.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.930
Get them, brothers!

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.900
Doctor, please take command!

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:01.400
Don't leave my side.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:08.380
You're like a knight protecting the princess.

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:12.540
Unfortunately, I don't have 
much time to play with you.

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:16.390
Run!

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:31.710
Hey, Misha! What's wrong?!

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:32.850
Hey!

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:35.310
Is this...

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:54.430
All righty.

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:55.960
Well, then.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:58.230
I'm taking the princess home with me.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:00.110
Wait!

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:12.710
Where's the Special Inspection Unit?!

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:16.420
They said they'd been delayed by Reunion.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:19.130
Impossible! They're our main force!

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.210
And also...

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.200
There's only one of them.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.090
What?

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:28.220
Don't tell me...

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:39.730
I won't let you!

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:42.880
Skullshatterer!

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:45.990
These guys... are pretty strong.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:50.100
We just got word from W.

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:51.870
The operation was a success.

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:56.560
Send Talulah a message.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:08.050
For someone who talks big,
 he sure runs quick.

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:11.770
What's wrong, little bunny?

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.640
Something doesn't seem right here.

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:17.140
They retreated so quickly...

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:21.000
What's that?

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.070
Reunion's target...

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:28.830
isn't Rhodes Island.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:32.430
Misha...

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.560
<i></i>(Lungmen Slang)

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.560
Ding nei go fai ah.

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:02.690
My goodness...

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:11.200
Madame Ch'en!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.500
What happened here?

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:15.420
Where's Misha?

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:19.710
Reunion took her.

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:22.840
Guess they were one step ahead.

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:25.190
Where did they go?

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:29.950
They disappeared behind that building.

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:32.720
We still don't know their exact location.

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:35.150
Misha...

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:36.430
This...

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:39.190
This is all my fault.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:41.750
Amiya...

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:44.940
It's okay, Doctor.

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:47.570
We should still be able to make it.

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:55.080
Madame Ch'en, why were you looking for Misha?

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.670
I have no reason to tell you that.

00:14:57.670 --> 00:14:58.330
No, you do.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:03.340
According to our contract, Rhodes Island 
is to follow the L.G.D.'s commands,

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:08.340
but a joint operation isn't going to 
work if we can't trust each other.

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:13.970
Rhodes Island made the decision to fight 
alongside the L.G.D. to defend Lungmen.

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:19.020
But even so, Lungmen isn't giving 
Rhodes Island any information.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:22.220
Your enemy isn't Rhodes Island.

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:23.310
It's Reunion.

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:31.410
You sounded a bit like that doctor just now.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.020
Huh?

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:33.820
All right, then.

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:37.880
It'll be a real headache 
if the contract gets torn up.

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:42.080
Let's go somewhere else to talk.

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:44.830
Huh?

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:48.340
Misha's father?

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:49.950
Yes.

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:52.870
We found out he was an 
influential man in Chernobog.

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:54.300
Influential?

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:58.350
A famous scientist and an 
important political figure.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:02.620
So Misha's being hunted because
 she's the kid of some big shot?

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:08.600
Does Misha have some sort of 
information on Chernobog, too?

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:13.590
We were taking her into custody to find out.

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:17.620
There's no telling how much she knows.

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:21.370
She could know nothing. 
She could know everything.

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:29.520
But Reunion has their sights on Lungmen next,
 and part of their plan was to abduct Misha.

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:34.130
We can't let them get their hands on anything,
 no matter how low the risk factor.

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:37.360
So that's how it is.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:39.390
That's all I have to say.

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.240
Where are you going?

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:43.970
To get Misha back.

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:45.920
We'll go with you!

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:48.400
This mission is the L.G.D.'s.

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:54.400
Besides, it's thanks to my negligence 
that Reunion abducted her.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:56.300
Madame Ch'en...

00:16:57.120 --> 00:17:01.280
I didn't expect the Monster Inspector 
to be such an honest gal.

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:04.060
I'm just trying to fulfill 
my responsibilities.

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:07.290
That's plenty splendid in its own right.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:12.490
This was a joint operation. 
Rhodes Island shares responsibility too.

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:14.550
Please let us come with you.

00:17:17.940 --> 00:17:24.060
Reunion forces are starting to gather 
around here. To slow us down, I assume.

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:28.970
Get into formation. 
We'll eliminate the Reunion threat.

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.070
Understood.

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:32.580
Let's go.

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:35.570
We'll clean this place up!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:48.830
Die!

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:51.940
Strike!

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.970
Show them what the L.G.D.'s capable of!

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:57.970
Advance!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:06.680
Attention all Rhodes Island Operators. 
Cover the L.G.D. and flank them from both sides.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:13.190
C-Captain! Try to keep 
the damage to a minimum!

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.550
I don't need you to tell me that!

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:19.380
Don't you dare think Lungmen is 
just going to let you trash the place!

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:20.570
Wow.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.940
Impressive, Monster Inspector.

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:24.580
She's intense.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:33.550
I didn't expect Reunion 
to have reached this scale.

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:38.070
Madame Ch'en!

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:44.350
Took you long enough.

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:46.270
Hoshiguma.

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:50.910
Ma'am! I apologize for my tardiness.

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:53.760
You'd better make up for it.

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:54.270
Roger.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.300
Take them all out in one go!

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:10.170
Amazing.

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:11.540
So this is...

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.920
the Lungmen Guard Department.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:40.070
Did the Special Inspection Unit 
really get tied down by just one of them?

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:42.690
Yes, unfortunately.

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:46.080
The enemy was exceptionally powerful. 
All we could do was stay on the defensive.

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:53.460
She even seemed distracted, 
like she had no interest in us whatsoever.

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:55.780
I see.

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:57.210
Madame Ch'en.

00:19:57.940 --> 00:19:59.870
Who is this?

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:01.970
Hoshiguma of the Special Inspection Unit.

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:04.260
One of the L.G.D.'s elites.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:06.220
It's nice to meet you.

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:10.180
This is Amiya, the leader of Rhodes Island.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.980
Wow! You're the leader?

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:18.320
Thank you very much for your help earlier.

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:23.360
Huh? Oh, no! I just did 
what anyone would've done.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:29.310
Hey, you said you were going to 
save Misha, so what's the plan now?

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:32.170
We find every single 
Reunion group and crush them.

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:33.480
What?!

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:35.670
That sounds like a tall order.

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:39.810
Whether it is or not,
 they must all be eliminated.

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:43.140
That's just an extermination operation.

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:44.180
Madame Ch'en.

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:49.620
We've already asked Penguin 
Logistics to track down Misha.

00:20:50.320 --> 00:20:54.060
I'm sure they'll find her in no time.

00:20:54.570 --> 00:21:01.230
And while we wait for news, we'll also engage
 Reunion in the slums and search for Misha.

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:07.070
From here on out, Rhodes Island 
will work with the L.G.D. to find Misha.

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:09.050
Are we agreed?

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:14.330
That's Rhodes Island's leader for you.

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:17.450
Some solid leadership skills there.

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:21.870
I can see why Old Ch'en sang your praises.

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:22.380
What?

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:22.870
Huh?

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:23.650
Oh my.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:24.300
Hey!

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:26.990
Whoops, slip of the tongue.

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:29.500
Madame Ch'en did?

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:33.220
Time to move.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:38.660
Looks like our inspector's 
got a cute side to her.

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:40.730
Let's just leave her be.

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:43.970
Misha...

00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:47.740
Doctor...

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:50.570
Amiya.

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:55.250
We'll get her back.

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:58.370
Right.

00:21:59.430 --> 00:22:01.160
Wait for us...

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:04.270
Misha.
